    "text": "Ancient Wisdom\nAyurveda is where we start. We respect the tradition and describe it as tradition, never as proof.\nModern Thinking\nCareful formulation development, clear ingredient identity and honest quality standards.\nBetter Living\nProducts designed for daily use, with plain labels and no exaggerated promises.\nBorn in Kashi, built for a new generation\nPlant, part and source, published in full\nTradition and evidence kept apart\nPlain language, read before you buy\nVaranasi, India\nKaayra Herbals\nAncient\nWisdom.\nModern Thinking.\nBetter Living.\nKaayra Herbals is a new Ayurvedic wellness company in Varanasi. We publish how we work, plant by plant, before we ask anyone to trust us.\nShop the collection\nOur approach\nJoin the launch list\nHow we work\nOur products are in development. Nothing is for sale yet, and nothing has been approved or tested.\nIllustration, not a product image.\nWhat we stand for\nOur philosophy\nSlow,\non purpose.\nHerbal wellness is crowded with big promises. We would rather explain what we are making, how we decide, and what we do not yet know.\nKaayra is built on Ayurveda as a living tradition. We treat it with respect, which includes being clear about the difference between traditional use and proven effect.\nRead our story\nThe collection\nMade in small,\nnamed\nbatches.\nAll products\nIngredient transparency\nName the plant.\nName the part.\nWe aim to publish ingredient identity in full, show real test reports when they exist, and keep tradition and evidence apart.\nQuality and transparency\nWhere product development stands\nAn educational reference to botanicals in Ayurveda. Listing a plant here does not mean it will be used in any Kaayra product.\nBrowse all ingredients\nOur roots\nRooted in\nKashi.\nKaayra Herbals began in Varanasi, the city of Kashi, long associated with learning and with Ayurvedic tradition.\nOur story\nQuestions\nPlain answers to\ncommon questions.\nThe journal\nReading,\nnot selling.\nAll articles\nThe launch list\nHear from us when there is\nsomething real\nto say.\nOptional, and only about our launch. We do not share your details, and you can ask us to remove them at any time.\nFrom Instagram"
